mission/{data.id}/reply {decision:\\\"reject\\\"}; никогда allow/once/always. Reply через bounded control lane, не ожидает completion prompt POST, HTTP budget<=.25s и cancel/deadline; failure -> явный security error+cleanup, без деградации в разрешение. Env=deny выставляет config permission={\\\"*\\\":\\\"deny\\\"} и session effect=deny, без пересборки; если всё же пришёл ask, только reject. Неподдержанная policy/отсутствие safe permission capability -> fail-closed. Нет автоматического deny↔ask_reject switching даже до prompt: разница позиций R1 закрыта явным выбором безопасного селектора. После принятия prompt 401/403 никогда не дают run fallback. EVD-050 + F-08 объясняют Zen403 с deny; FakeServe проверяет оба режима и byte hash _run_env, реальную Zen совместимость/запрещённую запись доказывает только H6. _run_env does NOT sanitize every branch; _serve_env must apply serve_env_sanitization to all3 branches. Mandatory form.created→cancel and reject/cancel→immediate interrupt single_turn_control; JSON args fallback input.ended.data.text when called absent; no second-step output. {\\\"trigger\\\": \\\"permission.asked on own session or form.created.data.form.sessionID on own session. Immediately latch step_closed/output barrier BEFORE sending any control reply; retain accumulated raw/tool arguments and suppress every later-step text/reasoning.\\\", \\\"order\\\": [\\\"Do not wait for pending prompt HTTP response or step.ended. Snapshot already received complete tool args/call ids; continue only bounded same-step argument finalization, never wait for Step2.\\\", \\\"Use idle Keep-Alive control lane: permission reply decision=reject OR form cancel within0.25s of validated event, including scheduling+I/O; no lsof/reconnect on this path.\\\", \\\"Immediately POST /api/session/{id}/interrupt (<=0.10s) after rejection/cancellation; single-turn guard suppresses Step2 even if server races interrupt. On any control error fail-closed and group kill.\\\", \\\"If mapped complete native call available, return it exactly once to DSH with finish_reason=tool_calls; otherwise apply existing _incomplete_step_signal/unmapped-tool recovery under same cap3/retry budgets. Preserve raw model data/provenance.\\\", \\\"Final cleanup DELETE/close/kill/reap. Avoid duplicate interrupt if already succeeded; cancellation notifications never release Step2 barrier.\\\"], \\\"latency\\\": \\\"permission/form first reply<=0.25s; immediate subsequent interrupt<=0.10s is distinct control cost within model-execution phase. Final cleanup API aggregate<=0.20s; no new lsof. Only own session/PGID.\\\", \\\"verification_ids\\\": [\\\"VER-005\\\"]}\",\n         \"verification_ids\": [\n@@ -2051,3 +2480,3 @@\n         \"scenario\": \"Unrestricted parent env утекает в serve или proxy creds в ошибку\",\n-        \"mitigation\": \"_run_env whitelist как legacy, password добавляется только child env; no apiKey dump, redact stdout/stderr/exception before _log and response; тест secret sentinels. _serve_env wrapper не меняет _run_env и сохраняет model catalog, private XDG data удаляется finally.\",\n+        \"mitigation\": \"_run_env only standalone branch whitelists; opencode-go/static inherit parent env baseline. New _serve_env filters exact allowlist on ALL3 branches before generated password/DB/state values, preserving only required routing/catalog/proxy/auth paths. OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_* and arbitrary API_KEY/TOKEN/SECRET sentinels absent; config/log/lease redacted. See AD-001.serve_env_sanitization; VER-005 branch matrix. _run_env remains byte-identical.\",\n         \"verification_ids\": [\n@@ -2067,3 +2496,3 @@\n         \"scenario\": \"Отмена клиента/oversized frame держит процессы и позволяет resource exhaustion\",\n-        \"mitigation\": \"bounded byte queue/frame/output and slots/waiters, finite per-operation deadlines, own PGID forced cleanup, zero orphan tests; output overflow не дропается молча.\",\n+        \"mitigation\": \"bounded byte queue/frame/output and